      "content": "that makes sense. one thing im worried about is the kitchen staff actually following through on it during the rush. like, how do i make sure they don't accidentally cross-contaminate or use the same utensils for the nut dishes and the allergy-safe ones? is there a specific protocol i should insist they follow?",
