      "content": "yeah color coding sounds good. i just want to make sure there aren't any \"hidden\" risks. like, what if the kitchen gets super chaotic and someone just grabs the wrong spoon because they're in a hurry? is there a way to set up a double-check system or something so we're not just relying on them being careful?",
